OL,3,GNEWSANew Sunday services added by East 
OL,4,AMidlands Railway                       
OL,6,FNew Sunday services are being added by 
OL,7,FEast Midlands Railway (EMR) as part of 
OL,8,Ftimetable changes.                     
OL,10,FThe shake-up from 13 December will see 
OL,11,Ftrains run on a Sunday between Lincoln 
OL,12,Fand Sleaford for the first time since  
OL,13,Fthe 1970s.                             
OL,15,FAnd Sunday morning services will be    
OL,16,Fadded for the first time between Crewe,
OL,17,FDerby and Nottingham.                  
OL,19,FEMR said the new services would be "a  
OL,20,Fboost for customers and businesses".   
